patch the loader create to use a system installed clang + WASI-SDK:

* Search for clang in $PATH
* Drop the download functionality (the downloaded SDK won't run on musl anyway)
  * Just fail if no clang is found in $PATH instead
* Update the target triple to clang to wask32-wasip1

diff --git a/crates/loader/src/loader.rs b/crates/loader/src/loader.rs
